[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7323.43, "timestamp": "02:02:03", "text": "录制。 就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7325.589, "timestamp": "02:02:05", "text": "正确的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7332.55, "timestamp": "02:02:12", "text": "让我完成这次跑步。 我只能给"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7335.589, "timestamp": "02:02:15", "text": "你看一个屏幕。 一秒钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7338.79, "timestamp": "02:02:18", "text": "所以，我的意思是，你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7344.39, "timestamp": "02:02:24", "text": "在 OBS 中开启这些设置。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7347.43, "timestamp": "02:02:27", "text": "对于图像源，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7351.43, "timestamp": "02:02:31", "text": "当图像不在活动场景中时，将会卸载图像。 对于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7354.07, "timestamp": "02:02:34", "text": "媒体文件，当文件不活动时会关闭文件，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7357.03, "timestamp": "02:02:37", "text": "当场景切换时会重新启动媒体文件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7360.55, "timestamp": "02:02:40", "text": "。 适用于浏览器。 一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7363.189, "timestamp": "02:02:43", "text": "关闭并重新启动。 接受这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7369.43, "timestamp": "02:02:49", "text": "呃，直播中断了。 等等，我的直播是不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7377.27, "timestamp": "02:02:57", "text": "嗯？ 等等，你说的“直播”是什么意思？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7379.669, "timestamp": "02:02:59", "text": "什么？"}]